---
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>About</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#0a0a0a] text-[#e0e0e0] font-mono">
    <Navbar />

    <main class="flex-grow container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-3xl">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-8">
  <img
    src="/images/avatar.png"
    alt="Professional pixel avatar"
    class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-gray-700"
    width="64"
    height="64"
  />
  <div>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Infrastructure & Cybersecurity Specialist</p>

  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-2">
  <a href="https://github.com/MxDurden" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-[#c0c0c0] p-1 rounded hover:opacity-80">
    <img src="/images/github.svg" alt="GitHub" class="w-7 h-7" />
  </a>
  <a href="www.linkedin.com/in/isaac-quezada-055776105" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-[#c0c0c0] p-1 rounded hover:opacity-80">
    <img src="/images/linkedin.svg" alt="LinkedIn" class="w-7 h-7" />
  </a>
  <a href="mailto:iq@isaacquezada.dev" class="bg-[#c0c0c0] p-1 rounded hover:opacity-80">
    <img src="/images/email.svg" alt="Email" class="w-7 h-7" />
  </a>
</div>

</div>

</div>

  <p class="mb-4">
    I'm a backend infrastructure and cybersecurity specialist focused on building secure, scalable, and automated systems. Over the past 20+ years, I’ve worked in enterprise environments, designing and maintaining mission-critical infrastructure for organizations of all sizes — including global corporations and high-demand production systems.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    While I’m not a full-time freelancer, I do take on select consulting gigs, open source projects, and technical mentoring during my spare time. I’ve provided hands-on support and solutions in areas like server hardening, CI/CD automation, cloud migrations, and DevSecOps strategy.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    I believe in building systems that are simple, robust, and secure by design — not as an afterthought. I favor minimalism, both in code and architecture, and I try to avoid overengineering whenever possible.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    Most of the work showcased here is either a side-project or the result of solving a real-world problem that I found interesting or challenging enough to build from scratch.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    This site is intentionally minimalist. No trackers. No bloat. Just signal.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you're looking to collaborate, hire, or just talk about infrastructure, automation, or security — <a href="/contact" class="text-green-400 underline hover:text-green-300">feel free to reach out</a>.
  </p>
</main>


    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
